[[Image:China ethnolinguistic 1967.jpg|thumb|Китай]]

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:inh|orv:Китаи}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|Китаи}}, from a {{der|ru|trk}} source, ultimately from {{der|ru|otk|𐰶𐰃𐱃𐰪|tr=Qïtaǰ|t=[[Khitan]]}}, from {{der|ru|zkt|^𘱿𘱤}} or {{m|zkt|^𘱿𘲫||Khitan}}, the Mongolic people who ruled Manchuria, then Northern China, then Central Asia from the 9th to 13th centuries. 

{{doublet|ru|кида́нь}}. Compare with {{ncog|kk|Қытай}}, {{ncog|ky|Кытай}}, {{ncog|be|Кітай}}, {{ncog|krc|Къытай}}, {{ncog|ug|خىتاي}}, {{ncog|uz|Xitoy}}, {{ncog|tk|Hytaý||China}}, {{ncog|mn|Хятад|t=China}}, {{ncog|zh|契丹}}, {{ncog|en|Cathay}}, etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|Кита́й}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-Китай.ogg}}

===Proper noun===
{{ru-proper noun+|Кита́й|n=both|adj=кита́йский}}

# {{tcl|ru|China|id=Q148}}
#: {{syn|ru|Поднебе́сная}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''Кита́е'''|t=in China}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''Кита́й'''|t=to China}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[из]] '''Кита́я'''|t=from China}}
# {{tcl|ru|China|id=Q29520}}

